      "desc:8": "A rotating-barrel wall of metal. The Minigun has an enormous rate of fire and burns through ammo just as fast, so bring a supply of drums.\n\nBuild it in the EV Assembler from six Hardened Steel Barrels, a Hardened Receiver, an EV electric motor, and titanium plates and screws. The motor spins the barrels. It is a ballistic gun, so it needs no charger. Its ammo drums are built empty, then filled with rifle bullets in the Ammo Press.\n\n[note]Hardened Receivers come from your HV days. If you have none, make some in the HV Assembler first.[/note]",
